"],["ARC or PLC in Towner County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/towner-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Towner County runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids sat at 33% of normal for February to March and 151% for October to November. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 37% and May to June at 131% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 34325 had its driest year in 1988 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
